<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept by trading house - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept by trading house - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Brent dates nominated from the paper chains on Monday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by trading house Arcadia, traders said.</p>
<p>Both of the cargoes are due to load in the June 24-26 window.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
